                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">Annex</hi> 6</head>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#italic">Prize Courts and Judgments</hi></p>
                <p>[Identical, <hi rendition="#italic">mutatis mutandis</hi>, to Annex 6 of the
                    Draft Rumanian Treaty and Annex 8 of the Draft Italian Treaty with the following
                    exceptions: the U.S. proposal supported by U.S.S.R. under B. Judgments of the
                    Rumanian and Italian annexes appears here as a U.S.S.R. proposal; the French
                    proposal under B. Judgments of the Rumanian and Italian annexes is not repeated
                    here.]</p>
            </div>
